5-08-22T10:48:23Z","body":"I think `add_autoload_singleton()` should not be an undo action at all. It's a side-effect of sharing the method with project settings dialog.\r\n\r\n> most stuff i see in the assetlib use add_autoload_singleton() in _enter_tree() and that's it...\r\n\r\nThey are wrong then. You could open an issue in their respective repos.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213938760/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213977181","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109825#issuecomment-3213977181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109825","id":3213977181,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_kWZd","user":{"login":"lord-muad-dib","id":185235730,"node_id":"U_kgDOCwp5Eg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185235730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib","html_url":"https://github.com/lord-muad-dib","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T11:03:05Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T11:03:05Z","body":"not trying to sound lazy or disrespectful, but most of them are like this. it would be more sensible to put errors or warnings on very bad behaviours or missing stuff when developing a plugin","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213977181/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213995890","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109825#issuecomment-3213995890","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109825","id":3213995890,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_ka9y","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T11:10:31Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T11:10:31Z","body":"It's part of EditorPlugin script template:\r\n```GDScript\r\n@tool\r\nextends EditorPlugin\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _enable_plugin() -> void:\r\n\t# Add autoloads here.\r\n\tpass\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _disable_plugin() -> void:\r\n\t# Remove autoloads here.\r\n\tpass\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\r\n\t# Initialization of the plugin goes here.\r\n\tpass\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:\r\n\t# Clean-up of the plugin goes here.\r\n\tpass\r\n```\r\nI'm not sure if there is a reasonable way to add a warning for this case. Adding singletons in `_enter_tree()` is also technically not wrong (i.e. it correctly adds the singleton), it's more a bad practice, because the singleton is registered in ProjectSettings and persists between editor sessions.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213995890/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3214104441","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109825#issuecomment-3214104441","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109825","id":3214104441,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_k1d5","user":{"login":"lord-muad-dib","id":185235730,"node_id":"U_kgDOCwp5Eg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185235730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib","html_url":"https://github.com/lord-muad-dib","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lord-muad-dib/r